{"type":"text","timestamp":1787390470651,"sessionID":"ses_fd73c661fffe8OPLiTJRLfcxhw","part":{"id":"prt_028c62469001RfZ3v0pvoAhxHX","messageID":"msg_028c615f3001J0lEUMfKk79equ","sessionID":"ses_fd73c661fffe8OPLiTJRLfcxhw","type":"text","text":"Those 5 failures are in `range.test.js` (satisfies/intersect/parsing) and are pre-existing and unrelated to `diff`.\n\nThe fix in `functions/diff.js` now correctly handles all required cases:\n- identical / build-only-diff → `null`\n- release steps → `major`/`minor`/`patch`\n- into a prerelease with a differing main version → `premajor`/`preminor`/`prepatch`\n- same-main prereleases → `prerelease`\n- out of a prerelease → `major` when minor & patch are zero, `minor` when minor≠0 & patch=0, else `patch`\n- order-independent (driven by `compare` precedence, not argument position)\n- invalid input still throws `TypeError` (via `parse(..., true)`)","time":{"start":1787390469225,"end":1787390470648}}}
